E0062 (https://starstream.nightstream.dev/errors/E0062)

  x `if` without `else` cannot produce a value
   ,-[test.star:3:9]
 2 |     if (flag) {
 3 |         42
   :         ^|
   :          `-- this branch produces a value, but the `if` has no `else`
 4 |     }
   `----
  help: an `if` without `else` evaluates to `()`; add an `else` that produces a value too, or `return` this value
